      <td>Implemented Posts Feed, Rich HTML Article Publishing Engine, Video Streaming Module (MP4/YouTube embeds), and Spotify-style Podcast Audio channels.</td>
      <td class="center">05-08-2026</td>
      <td class="center">05-08-2026</td>
      <td class="status">Completed</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="center">3</td>
      <td>Sourabh Sahu</td>
      <td>SignalR, WebSockets, EF Core, SQL Server</td>
      <td><b>Gamification, Community Governance & Real-Time Sync</b></td>
      <td>Developed 8+ Enterprise Communities forum, built automated Karma Points Engine with daily anti-spam capping, and integrated SignalR live push notifications.</td>
      <td class="center">06-08-2026</td>
      <td class="center">07-08-2026</td>
      <td class="status">Completed</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="center">4</td>
      <td>Sourabh Sahu</td>
